@*
The templates of the public pages: Razor layouts with the same path as the user controls of the WebForms site
(Templates/AnotherRed/Cuyahoga.ascx -> Templates/AnotherRed/Cuyahoga.cshtml). The stylesheets and images of the
templates stay in the WebForms site.
- <cuyahoga-head-assets />: the meta tags, stylesheets and scripts of the page
- <cuyahoga-placeholder id="..." />: a placeholder for sections and custom menus
- <vc:hierarchical-menu />: the navigation (Another Red, Default)
- <vc:navigation-level-zero-one />, <vc:navigation-level-two />: the main menu and the submenu (Classic)
*@
@using Cuyahoga.Web.Core.PublicSite
@inherits TemplatePage
@addTagHelper *, Cuyahoga.Web.Core
